# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Coloring Book PDF Generator — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your actual values.
# NEVER commit `.env.local` — it's already in .gitignore.

# ── Turso (libSQL) Database ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://app.turso.tech (web dashboard)
#   1. Create a database named "coloring-books"
#   2. Click the database → Settings → copy the URL
#   3. Click "Create Auth Token" → copy the token
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://coloring-books-YOUR-HANDLE.turso.io
TURSO_DIRECT_URL=libsql://coloring-books-YOUR-HANDLE.turso.io
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-turso-auth-token-here

# ── Vercel Blob (file storage) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Get this from: Vercel Dashboard → your project → Storage → Create Blob Store
# The token is auto-added to your project's env vars as BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=your-vercel-blob-token-here

# ── App URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For local dev: http://localhost:3000
# For production: https://your-app.vercel.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Z.AI API Key (OPTIONAL — only for local AI image generation) ─────
# NOT needed for the deployed app. Only used when running
# `bun run scripts/generate-images.ts` locally to create new coloring
# book images via AI. The SDK reads this automatically when available.
# Get from: https://z.ai → API Keys
# ZAI_API_KEY=your-zai-api-key-here
